      "id": "dc-e1-l01-ni-vs-nin",
      "focus": ["你", "您"],
      "short_explanation": {
        "zh-Hans": "“您”比“你”更尊敬、更正式。初学时，面对老师、长辈或需要表示尊重的人，可以优先使用“您”。实际选择也会受到关系、年龄、地区和场合影响。",
        "en": "您 is more respectful and formal than 你. Beginners can use 您 with teachers, older people, or when showing respect; actual usage also depends on relationship, age, region, and setting."
      },
      "translation_strategy": "localize_social_distance_not_word_only",
      "review_state": "draft"
    }
  ],
